    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p>A <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Gungan\" title=\"Gungan\">Gungan</a> weapon, the Atlatl adds speed and power as an extension of a throwing arm, allowing the user to hurl <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Energy_Balls\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Energy Balls\">Energy Balls</a> farther than with just an unaided toss. If forced into close combat, the wielder can use the Atlatl as a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Club\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Club\">Club</a>-like melee weapon. </p><p>Although the Atlatl is considered an <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Exotic_Weapon\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Exotic Weapon\">Exotic Weapon</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Gungans\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Gungans\">Gungans</a> are treated as proficient if they have the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_(Simple_Weapons)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Weapon Proficiency (Simple Weapons)\">Weapon Proficiency (Simple Weapons)</a> feat. </p><p><b>Special:</b> Can be used to hurl <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Energy_Balls\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Energy Balls\">Energy Balls</a> </p>",
